  Description: "Wielding an artifact stolen from the grave of The Ogem Makina Prima,
    the Strategist molds and bends reality into inextricable mazes of madness. They
    specialize in controlling effects that displace and confound, setting up allies
    for plays while impeding enemies. \r\n\r\nWhen the situation calls for a heavier
    hand, the Strategist can construct their various Makina onto the battlefield,
    geometric nightmares that tear apart enemies at the behest of their creator\u2019s
    guiding hand. "
